# Wave T28 (Fairhaven kit): canvasroof — Fairhaven's own roof kind.
# STITCHED CANVAS panels over a tile ridge: horizontal canvas
# sheets with seam rows and stitch ticks, a darker tile cap row
# along the top — the market's own material carried onto the
# Contest Hall, the Maritime Museum and the town's cottages. In
# the KIT_VARIANTS slateport roof tones (#d9c096/#a68a5c/#ecd9ae,
# log #8d6a3a, door #b0874f). Structurally canvas sheets + ridge,
# not a recolour: Mistford wears vertical-split wood shakes,
# Copperton wide slabs with copper seams, Meadowbrook small
# staggered stone shingles, Eldergrove banded thatch.
# (NO-SAME-KIT law; WAVE-T28-FAIRHAVEN-PLAN.md.)
